From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:30:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: keep the current rendition and let each queue item
 choose another

Retry a fresh address at the active resolution after a segment authorization failure. Show actual source resolutions in the queue and retain isolated segment data across manual switches, pause and process restore. Keep external downloader handoff and the source playback preference independent.
